+// E9 (tribusca-control#116, continuidade P2-c): RFB acceptance is DATA pinned to the lot entry digest and the engine.
+test('E9 RFB acceptance: only a COMPLETE reading with a record pinning its lot digest AND the current engine is accepted', async () => {
